----                             6848  ; Return ABI:  ; [section code]
----                             6849  ; - forwards D0-D3 from prvm_run_68000 on success  ; [section code]
----                             6850  ; - returns deterministic nonzero status with D1-D3 cleared on route failure  ; [section code]
